Design a circuit for detecting edges in a 4-bit input signal. The module captures the current and previous states of the input on the rising edge of the clock signal. When a change in the input occurs (i.e., when the current input differs from the previous input), the output is updated to reflect the previous input state. This functionality allows for the identification of transitions within the input signal, effectively implementing edge detection for 4-bit data.
