Build a 4-bit binary counter with synchronous active high reset signal and parallel load capability.
// (1) reset: Resets the counter to zero.
// (2) load: Loads the counter with data.
// (3) data: Data to be loaded into the counter.
// (4) q: The value of the counter.

module binary_counter_with_load(
